; What the override panel needs of the Flow Nexus: the seat an override
; acts on, the state that seat is in now, and Flow's Memory of overrides.
;
; A Subject is what an override names, a flow or a permaflow's Address. Its
; Seat is the flow and the Address it runs at: the flow named and the
; Address whose flow it is or was, or the flow an Address is Awake as, else
; the last flow of its Past. A Transitioned is one transition of one seat,
; what an override records with the cause Overridden. Holding is the
; panel's switch: Held since a moment, or Acting on its own.
;
; EntersByOverride is a state entered by an override: its transition, the
; cause Overridden, the moment now.
;
; DescribesOverrideTable names the table a record of the override panel is
; kept in: a flow's transitions, and the switch.
;
; RemembersOverrides is the store's: it appends a seat's transition to its
; flow's record, reads every flow's record, reads and sets the switch,
; forgets a flow (its row, route, role, owner proof, events and context
; size, and its place in its metaflow's Past) in the commit that records its
; transition, finds the seat a subject names, and lists every seat Awake as
; a live flow. HeedsOverrides is the Nexus's: whether it is held, which
; every act it takes on its own asks first, its clocks, its deliveries and
; its launches; the state a seat is in now: no harness, Asleep; else its
; last transition's (transitions.ethos); else Acting; the seat a subject names, refused UnknownFlow or UnknownAddress
; when there is none; and the override's transition recorded, the cause
; Overridden, the moment now: for a seat in the state the override puts it
; in, for the seat a subject names in the state it is in now (nothing when
; it names no seat), and for every live seat as it stands.
;
; A Renew answers its fresh flow's Started: the old flow's running turn is
; interrupted, then its harness closed, so no turn of it runs on against
; tool calls refused FlowEnded. InterruptsRunningTurns is the Nexus's: the
; seat's running turn interrupted, whatever its harness; a Claude seat
; seen Working or Blocked in its pane is pressed its harness's interrupt
; keys under its pane lease, a Codex seat's thread is asked of its
; app-server. InterruptsCodexThreads is the app-server adapter's: the
; thread's newest turn read and, while it is in progress, interrupted
; (turn/interrupt). A TurnInterruption says what became of the turn:
; none ran, its harness was told to stop it, or its harness could not be
; told, and why.

Library
[ :flow_nexus:store:[ FlowStore StoreError ]                ; imports
  :sema_engine:[ TableDescriptor ]
  :flow_nexus:[ RunningNexus ]
  :flow_nexus:generated:memory:[ Flow Transition Moment StoredHold ]
  :meta_signal_flow:generated:signal:[ State MetaOutput.Output ]
  :flow_nexus:codex:[ CodexAdapter CodexAdapterUnavailable ]
  :signal_flow:[ FlowId Address ] ]
[ Subject.[ Named.FlowId                                    ; types: what an override names
            Permaflow.Address ]
  Seat.{ FlowId Address }                                   ;   a flow at its Address
  Transitioned.{ Seat Transition }                          ;   one transition of one seat
  Holding.[ Held.Moment                                     ;   the panel's switch
            Acting ]
  CodexThread.String                                        ;   a Codex thread, by its id
  TurnInterruption.[ Rested                                 ;   what became of a seat's running turn: none ran
                     Interrupted                            ;     its harness was told to stop it
                     PaneUnreadable                         ;     Herdr could not read the Claude seat's pane
                     KeysRefused                            ;     Herdr refused the interrupt keys
                     AppServerRefused.String                ;     the Codex app-server was not reached, or refused, and why
                     StoreRefused.String ] ]                ;     Memory could not name the seat's harness, and why
[ RemembersOverrides.[ record_transition.{ [ Transitioned ] [ Result<Boolean StoreError> ] } ; traits
                       transitions.[ Result<Vector<Flow> StoreError> ]
                       holding.[ Result<Holding StoreError> ]
                       switch.{ [ Holding ] [ Result<Boolean StoreError> ] }
                       forget_flow.{ [ Transitioned ] [ Result<Boolean StoreError> ] }
                       seat.{ [ Subject ] [ Result<Option<Seat> StoreError> ] }
                       seats.[ Result<Vector<Seat> StoreError> ] ]
  HeedsOverrides.[ held.[ Boolean ]
                   state_now.{ [ Seat ] [ State ] }
                   seat_named.{ [ Subject ] [ Result<Seat MetaOutput> ] }
                   record_override.{ [ Transitioned ] [ Result<Boolean MetaOutput> ] }
                   record_named.{ [ Subject ] [ Result<Boolean MetaOutput> ] }
                   record_every_seat.[ Result<Boolean MetaOutput> ] ]
  DescribesOverrideTable.[ descriptor:[ TableDescriptor<Self> ] ]
  EntersByOverride.[ overridden.[ Transition ] ]
  InterruptsRunningTurns.[ interrupt_running_turn.{ [ Seat ] [ TurnInterruption ] } ]
  InterruptsCodexThreads.[ interrupt_thread.{ [ CodexThread ] [ Result<TurnInterruption CodexAdapterUnavailable> ] } ] ]
[ FlowStore.[ RemembersOverrides ]                          ; associations
  RunningNexus.[ HeedsOverrides
                 InterruptsRunningTurns ]
  CodexAdapter.[ InterruptsCodexThreads ]
  Flow.[ DescribesOverrideTable ]
  StoredHold.[ DescribesOverrideTable ]
  State.[ EntersByOverride ] ]
